WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.903
Hi! Today we travel around the world. You'll learn
countries, languages and all the persons of a verb.

2
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.454
I'm from Colombia.

3
00:00:18.067 --> 00:00:19.328
I live in Berlin.

4
00:00:22.733 --> 00:00:25.400
I speak Spanish and a little German.

5
00:00:30.867 --> 00:00:38.021
Ich wohne, du wohnst, er wohnt, wir wohnen, ihr wohnt, sie
wohnen. Remember: wir and sie have the same form as the
infinitive.

6
00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:46.220
Careful with sprechen! With du and er, the e changes to i:
du sprichst, er spricht.

7
00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.231
Where is Carlos from?

8
00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:52.736
He's from Peru. He speaks Spanish and English.

9
00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:53.894
And Julia?

10
00:00:54.233 --> 00:00:55.577
She's from Switzerland.

11
00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.734
Now it's your turn. Listen and repeat.

12
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.194
Listen carefully and point to the right picture!

13
00:01:29.067 --> 00:01:29.976
die Türkei

14
00:01:35.667 --> 00:01:36.710
die Niederlande

15
00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:41.958
What's correct? Think for a moment!

16
00:01:47.167 --> 00:01:49.010
die Schweiz → aus der Schweiz.

17
00:01:52.333 --> 00:01:54.158
What's correct? Think for a moment!

18
00:01:58.633 --> 00:02:00.955
Maria and Paul = sie (plural) → kommen.

19
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:08.041
Great! And you? Where are you from and which languages do
you speak?
